'l' lets you look at where you are.  'l' followed by an
argument, such as 'l hannah' or 'l sword' allows you to
look at that object.
 
'hp' allows you to check your current condition in terms
of hp (hit points), mana (spell points), and ftg (fatigue).
 
'i' will tell you what you currently have in your inventory
i.e. what you are holding.    

'score' will give you a nice screenful of information
about the overall status of your character including things
like age, stats, sex, gender, and all that.

'list' followed by 'stats' will print out your stats.  Followed
by 'skills' it will print out your guild skills, if you
are in a guild (we'll talk about guilds later).

